## Local-only reference checkouts (not distributed)

Directories under `vendor/` that are listed in `.gitignore`
(e.g. `vendor/unsloth/`) are local research checkouts. They are not tracked
in this repository, are excluded from the GitHub stage manifest
(`scripts/packaging/github_stage_manifest.json`), and are not part of any
Jenny distribution. Their licenses are governed by their upstream projects.

Runtime dependencies installed via npm (`package.json`) and pip
(from `pyproject.toml`) carry their own licenses; see each package's
metadata. The packaged application emits an SBOM for the Python sidecar
during release builds (`npm run sbom:sidecar`).
